Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:10.74,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:12.47,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,Brother, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.81,0:00:12.47,Helvetica,,0,0,410,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:35.13,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,What's this?! Stop it!
